{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_380E80","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Boss，再让我报告一件事。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":35,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"还有事吗……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":22,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"Amanda所在的“医务室”，\n如果再出现伤员或病人，也打算收治他们。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不过，要是不进行适当治疗，\n本来能治好的伤也治不好。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":77,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"嗯。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":7,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"所以为了照顾伤员和病人，\n我打算成立“医疗班”。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"医疗班的人数和能力够高的话，\n也能加快伤病的恢复。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":74,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"平时也打算让他们负责士兵们的健康管理。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":58,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"是啊。与其等生病了再头疼，\n预防更重要。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":59,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"没错。\nBoss，你也别忘了“洗手、漱口”。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"要是有那种闲工夫就好了……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":43,"review_flag":""}]}